<Majesty>
	<SteamWorkshop id="3778947832" visibility="Public">
		<Title lang="en_US">Majesty Gold HD QoL Utilities</Title>
		<Description lang="en_US">A standalone installer for ten Majesty Gold HD quality-of-life improvements.

Supports both Default Public 1.5.2.24 and beta2 Steam Multiplayer Support 1.5.2.28. Each utility can be installed or removed independently.

Subscribe, open the Workshop item folder, close Majesty, and run Majesty QoL Utilities.exe. The app identifies the selected supported game build before enabling executable patches.

The download contains no Majesty game assets. Changes are applied only to your local game installation or preferences when you run the app.

Full patch details, source code, and individual utility documentation are linked from the app.</Description>
		<ContentPath>C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Majesty HD\SDK\Mods\MajestyQoLUtilitiesUpload\content</ContentPath>
		<PreviewImagePath>C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\Majesty HD\SDK\Mods\MajestyQoLUtilitiesUpload\workshop-preview.jpg</PreviewImagePath>
